{"id": "86188", "name": "AlgMap-11.1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "The equation \\( c = ab \\) can be described as the subject, \\(c\\), in terms of \\(a\\) and \\(b\\). It is also possible to obtain equivalent expressions of the from: <br>\n<br>\n\\(a\\) in terms of \\(b\\) and \\(c\\). <br>\n\\(b\\) in terms of \\(a\\) and \\(c\\). <br>\n<br>\nIdentify these expressions: <br>\n<br>\n\\(a\\) = [[input:ans1]]\n[[validation:ans1]] <br>\n[[feedback:prt1]]\n\n<br>\n\\(b\\) = [[input:ans2]]\n[[validation:ans2]]\n[[feedback:prt2]]", "generalfeedback": "To rearrange the equation \\(c = ab\\) to make \\(a\\) the subject divide both sides of the equation by \\(b\\) to give:\n\\[ a = \\frac{c}{b}. \\]\nTo make \\(b\\) the subject just divide by \\(a\\):\n\\[ b = \\frac{c}{a}. \\]", "specificfeedback": "", "prtcorrect": "<span class='correct'>Correct answer, well done.</span>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<span class='partially'>Your answer is partially correct.</span>", "prtincorrect": "<span class='incorrect'>Incorrect answer.</span>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "1-0